	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Good morning, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mh...”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"The first thing I see when I open my eyes is Elsa's face, looming right above mine.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What's the matter? Aren't you happy to see me?”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What are you doing in my futon?”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"I parted ways with Elsa before I got home yesterday.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"And I'm pretty sure I went to sleep alone last night.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh you, getting embarrassed over every little thing.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It's not like this is our first time sleeping together or anything, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's not the problem here.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What else, pray tell, could the problem be?”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Elsa whispers, leaning in even closer.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"We're close enough for our noses to brush against each other.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"I roll over without a reply.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"If I'd kept up our eye contact any longer, I'm not sure I would have been able to restrain myself.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"The two of us have been busy lately, so we haven't been able to spend any time together as lovers.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hey, don't you run away from me.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You can't call this running away.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Elsa reproachfully pokes me in the back.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Still, though, I sure wasn't expecting it to be this easy. You\ndidn't notice me at all.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What would you have done if I were an enemy?”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"I don't have anything to say for myself.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Under normal circumstances, my eyes would've been wide open the instant anyone slid open the door to my room.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Did Elsa take advantage of her elite covert operative skills to sneak into my futon?",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"No, I'm just losing my edge.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"Whenever I spend time with Elsa, I get way too excited and careless as a result.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"Clearly, I need to strengthen my willpower.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I spent ages right here just watching you sleep, but you\ndidn't seem like you were gonna ever wake up.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If you'd kept it up, I just might've slipped it off...”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, oopsies. I meant that I just might've slipped off. To sleep.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you're that sleepy, you're welcome to borrow my futon.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"Elsa puffs out her cheeks at my refusal to rise to her provocation.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“No thank you, I'm not actually all that tired. I just wanted an excuse to do this.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"Elsa reaches out towards me.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"Her two arms gently cradle my head against her body.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"Her soft chest firmly buries itself against the back of my head.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hehee. That tickles.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"The sensation of her chest against my head is warm and soft beyond description.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"She leans down and nuzzles her cheek against the top of my head.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"A wonderful scent tickles my nostrils, and despite just having just woken up, my mind feels hazy and feverish.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We should really be getting up.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"I force out the words, slipping out of Elsa's embrace to sit upright.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"It takes the full measure of my flagging willpower to resist her seduction.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"Plus, we'll definitely be late for school if we let this go any further.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm not letting you get away that easily.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"Elsa counterattacks by flopping down onto my lap.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“C'mooon, why don't we just spend the day like this?”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We've been so busy recently, you know? Haven't you also been wanting to spend some quality time together?”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"Elsa croons, rubbing her cheek against my lap.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Today's a weekday. We have school.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Just skip school and cuddle with meee.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"Elsa pouts and whines, still refusing to get up.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Should the student council president really be saying that?”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hmph. Is school really more important to you than spending time with me?”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"She flings back a sulky retort.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"Elsa's been acting odd this whole morning.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"She's never usually this needy for affection.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Aren't you the busy one here?”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"It's only been a few months since the Empire gained its independence from the Republic.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"As Empress Hisui's political advisor, Elsa spends each and every day locked in long debates with Imperial politicians over the merits of introducing democracy.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“For once, my schedule happens to be all free today.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That's why I thought it'd be nice to go to school together with you for once.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In that case, let me go so I can get ready.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Buuut, the more I watched you sleep, the more I wanted us to stay like this just a little longer.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I seem to remember you going on about how you still wanted to attend school every once in a while.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Well, you're not wrong...”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Haah, I suppose you win this time. Let's get up.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"Elsa finally gets off my lap, though not without one last pout.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"It immediately feels lonely not being able to feel her body heat next to me, and I very nearly reach out to her.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"It's been just as long for me, and I want to spend some quality time with her just as badly.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"But I don't want to get in the way of her work, nor this rare chance for her to be able to show her face at school.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"And I would never blame her for prioritizing those things over me.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Let me make breakfast at least.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It'll be a Republican breakfast, though, so it might not be to your tastes.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Everything you make is delicious.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm glad to hear it, but that's not exactly good for my motivation, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I want you to be honest to me when it tastes bad, or else I\nwon't get any better.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I wanna make the best food possible for you.”",
